---
// 對話框：左邊頭像（沒有照片用像素角色）、名字牌、打字機文字、閃爍的 ▼
import Px from './Px.astro';
import { getProfile, img } from '../../../lib/site';
interface Props { text: string; speaker?: string; class?: string; big?: boolean }
const p = (await getProfile()).data;
const { text, speaker = p.name, class: cls, big = false } = Astro.props;
const avatar = img(p.avatar);
---
<div class:list={['dlg', { big }, cls]}>
  <div class="dlg-face">
    {avatar ? <img src={avatar} alt="" loading="lazy" /> : <Px name="hero" scale={big ? 6 : 4} class="bob" />}
  </div>
  <div class="dlg-body box t-line">
    <span class="dlg-who">{speaker}</span>
    <p class="dlg-text" data-type>{text}</p>
    <slot />
    <Px name="down" scale={3} class="dlg-next blink" />
  </div>
</div>
